{"rsid":2686,"house":"Rajya Sabha","name":"Shri Rajendra Hiralal Jain","reviewed_at":"2026-10-29T22:19:46.654Z","sections":{"questions":{"source":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/Question/GetMeber_Question?mpcode=2686","status":"available","total":3,"source_total":3,"records":[{"mp_code":2686,"qslno":328266,"qtitle":"Development of medical colleges in Gondia and Bhandara","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"11.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-11T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":2675,"name":"Rajendra Hiralal Jain                   ","min_name":"HEALTH AND FAMILY WELFARE","qn_text":"(a) whether it is in the cognizance of Government that the construction work of Government Medical College in Gondia, Maharashtra, has not yet been completed;\r\n(b) whether any proposal is under consideration to provide financial assistance for completing the construction work of the said medical college through any Central Government scheme or central assistance; and\r\n(c) whether the Central Government proposes to provide financial assistance or necessary support to the State Government under any central scheme for the establishment and development of the said medical college and if so, the details thereof?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":29,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2675_rcmkP9.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2675_rcmkP9.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2675_rcmkP9.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2675_rcmkP9.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2675_rcmkP9.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2675_rcmkP9.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2686,"qslno":327917,"qtitle":"Introduction of new Superfast train between Gondia and Mumbai","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"07.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-07T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":2359,"name":"Rajendra Hiralal Jain                   ","min_name":"RAILWAYS","qn_text":"(a) whether Government is considering introducing a new daily Superfast, Vande Bharat, or Express train between Gondia and Mumbai or extending existing rail services, in view of the long-standing demand from Gondia and Eastern Vidarbha; and \r\n(b) if so, the details thereof and if not, the reasons therefor?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2359_YId0pg.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2359_YId0pg.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2359_YId0pg.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2359_YId0pg.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2359_YId0pg.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2359_YId0pg.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2686,"qslno":327043,"qtitle":"Development of Gondia Railway Junction","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"31.07.2026","adate":"2026-07-31T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":1557,"name":"Rajendra Hiralal Jain                   ","min_name":"RAILWAYS","qn_text":"(a) whether Government has taken cognizance of the fact that Gondia Junction is one of the major railway junctions in the country, from where a large number of mail/express and superfast trains pass every day, but many of these trains do not stop at Gondia, causing serious inconvenience to millions of passengers, students, traders and patients; and\r\n(b) if so, the details of such trains and the reasons for not providing stoppage facilities to these trains?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU1557_emUc3Z.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1557_emUc3Z.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU1557_emUc3Z.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU1557_emUc3Z.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU1557_emUc3Z.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU1557_emUc3Z.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null}]},"special_mentions":{"source":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/memberGe